36 48H13V50H36z" opacity=".1"></path></svg></span><div class="wt-pl-xs-3 wt-pb-xs-3 wt-pr-xs-3"><p aria-hidden="true" data-listing-type-label="true" class="wt-text-title-large">Digital files</p><p data-listing-type-description="true">A digital file that buyers will download.</p></div></div></div></div></div></fieldset></div></div><div id="field-whenMade" class="wt-mt-md-6 wt-mt-xs-4"><div class="le-width-when-made__select"><label for="when-made-select" class="wt-label wt-mb-xs-1">When was it made? <span data-testid="required-badge" aria-hidden="true" data-required-text="Required" class="wt-label__required"></span></label><div data-clg-id="WtSelect" class="wt-select"><select id="when-made-select" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="" class="wt-select__element fs-unmask"><option value="">When was it made?</option><optgroup label="Not yet made"><option value="made_to_order">Made to order</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Recently"><option value="2020_2026">2020 - 2026</option><option value="2010_2019">2010 - 2019</option><option value="2007_2009">2007 - 2009</option></optgroup><optgroup label="Vintage"><option value="before_2007">Before 2007</option><option value="2000_2006">2000 - 2006</option><option value="1990s">1990s</option><option value="1980s">1980s</option><option value="1970s">1970s</option><option value="1960s">1960s</option><option value="1950s">1950s</option><option value="1940s">1940s</option><option value="1930s">1930s</option><option value="1920s">1920s</option><option value="1910s">1910s</option><option value="1900s">1900 - 1909</option><option disabled="" value="1800s">1800s</option><option disabled="" value="1700s">1700s</option><option disabled="" value="before_1700">Before 1700</option></optgroup></select></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-clg-id="WtGridItem" class="wt-grid__item-xs-12"><div data-clg-id="WtGrid" id="item-details" class="wt-bg-white wt-b-xs le-rounded-02 wt-p-xs-3 wt-p-md-5 wt-mt-xs-2 wt-grid"><div data-clg-id="WtGridItem" class="wt-grid__item-xs-12 wt-grid__item-tv-12"><div><h2 class="wt-text-title-large">Item details</h2><p class="wt-text-caption wt-sem-text-secondary">Help buyers understand your item better, and share any special options you offer.</p></div><div data-clg-id="WtGridItem" class="wt-grid__item-xs-12 wt-grid__item-lg-8"><div id="field-title" class="wt-mt-md-7 wt-mt-xs-5"><label for="listing-title-input" class="wt-label wt-mb-xs-0">Title <span data-testid="required-badge" aria-hidden="true" data-required-text="Required" class="wt-label__required"></span><div data-clg-id="WtPopoverControlled" class="wt-popover"><button type="button" aria-describedby="popover-content-c12ab5c4-4030-4c3e-846a-e6d81da1f168" aria-label="Help" class="wt-popover__trigger wt-text-body-01"><span class="wt-mr-xs-1 wt-nudge-b-1 wt-icon--base-xs etsy-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13.059 17H10.677V14.744H13.059zM12.195 7C14.034 7 15.398 8.045 15.398 9.744 15.398 10.747 14.828 11.568 14.173 12.056L13.602 12.5C13.058 12.919 12.878 13.254 12.878 13.951H10.858C10.858 12.626 11.178 12.013 12.056 11.358L12.585 10.983C13.058 10.635 13.268 10.26 13.268 9.827 13.268 9.16 12.822 8.755 12.14 8.755 11.276 8.755 10.774 9.285 10.774 10.356H8.602C8.602 8.31 9.995 7 12.195 7"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C17.523 2 22 6.477 22 12S17.523 22 12 22 2 17.523 2 12 6.477 2 12 2M12 4.5A7.5 7.5 0 1 0 12 19.5 7.5 7.5 0 0 0 12 4.5"></path></svg></span></button><div role="tooltip" id="popover-content-c12ab5c4-4030-4c3e-846a-e6d81da1f168"><h3 class="wt-text-caption-title wt-mb-xs-1">Tips for a great title:</h3><ul class="wt-mb-xs-2"><li class="wt-text-caption wt-mb-xs-1">Clearly state the item for sale, like "mug" or "dress"</li><li class="wt-text-caption wt-mb-xs-1">Include the most important traits upfront, like your item's colour, material, and size</li><li class="wt-text-caption wt-mb-xs-1">Streamline for clarity and scannability. Consider using less than 15 words when including the traits that make your item special.</li><li class="wt-text-caption wt-mb-xs-1">Only include celebrations, special occasions, or recipient types if they're essential to what the item is, like "birthday candle" or "Halloween costume"</li><li class="wt-text-caption wt-mb-xs-1">Move subjective words, like "perfect" or "beautiful", to the description</li><li class="wt-text-caption wt-mb-xs-1">Try not to repeat words</li><li class="wt-text-caption">Don't worry about adding info about price, delivery, or sales. Etsy helps take care of this by badging your items in Search.</li></ul><p class="wt-mb-xs-2 wt-mt-xs-2 wt-text-caption">Make sure your listing, including the terms in your title, meets our <a data-clg-id="WtTextLink" target="_blank" href="https://www.etsy.com/legal/sellers" class="wt-sem-text-primary wt-text-link">Seller Policy<span class="wt-screen-reader-only">Opens a new tab</span></a>.</p><p class="wt-mb-xs-2 wt-mt-xs-2 wt-text-caption"><a data-clg-id="WtTextLink" target="_blank" href="https://www.etsy.com/seller-handbook/article/1399426136697" class="wt-sem-text-primary wt-text-link">Learn more about suggested titles<span class="wt-screen-reader-only">Opens a new tab</span></a></p><span class="wt-popover__arrow"></span></div></div></label><p id="listing-title-helper-text" class="wt-text-caption wt-display-block  wt-mb-xs-1">Make sure your title is easy to understand and clearly describes what you’re selling.</p><div class="wt-mt-xs-2 wt-mb-xs-2"></div><textarea name="title" id="listing-title-input" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="listing-title-character-count listing-title-helper-text" aria-required="true" rows="1" class="fs-unmask wt-textarea wt-textarea--resize-none" style="height: 58.6667px !important;"></textarea><div class="wt-display-flex-xs wt-justify-content-space-between wt-align-items-flex-start"><div><div id="titles-adoption-heuristic-warnings" class="fs-unmask wt-text-gray wt-display-flex-xs wt-mt-xs-1"><div style="margin-right: 3px;"><span class="wt-icon--smaller-xs wt-fill-grey wt-display-inline-flex-xs wt-flex-shrink-xs-0 etsy-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.962 20C15.306 20 15.547 20.34 15.392 20.648 14.687 22.06 13.432 23 12 23S9.315 22.06 8.608 20.648C8.454 20.34 8.695 20 9.04 20z"></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12 1A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 16.486 16.719 1 1 0 0 0 16 17.562C16 18.08 15.58 18.5 15.063 18.5H8.936A.94.94 0 0 1 8 17.563C8 17.217 7.807 16.902 7.514 16.719A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 12 1M11.5 11A.5.5 0 0 0 11 11.5V16A.5.5 0 0 0 11.5 16.5H12.5A.5.5 0 0 0 13 16V11.5A.5.5 0 0 0 12.5 11z"></path></svg></span></div><div style="margin-top: 2px;"><p class="wt-text-title-small">Tips to improve your title</p><ul data-clg-id="WtList" class="wt-list wt-text-body-small"><li data-clg-id="WtListItem">Consider using 14 words or less</li><li data-clg-id="WtListItem">Try to avoid repetition: <span class="wt-text-title-small">“wall”, “art”</span></li></ul></div></div></div><span id="listing-title-character-count" data-testid="listing-title-character-count" class="le-text-caption wt-text-gray wt-mt-xs-1 wt-ml-xs-1">139/140</span></div></div></div><div data-clg-id="WtGrid" class="wt-mt-md-6 wt-mt-xs-4 wt-grid"><div data-clg-id="WtGridItem" class="wt-pr-lg-4 wt-grid__item-xs-12 wt-grid__item-lg-8"><div id="field-description"><label for="listing-description-textarea" class="wt-label wt-mb-xs-0">Description <span data-testid="required-badge" aria-hidden="true" data-required-text="Required" class="wt-label__required"></span></label><p id="listing-description-helper-text" class="wt-text-caption wt-display-block wt-mb-xs-1">What makes your item special? Buyers will only see the first few lines unless they expand the description.</p><div data-clg-id="WtGridItem" class="wt-hide-lg wt-mt-xs-2 wt-mt-lg-0 wt-mb-xs-2 wt-mb-lg-0 wt-grid__item-xs-12"><div 