have outgrown my current production space</option><option value="high_demand">I need help meeting demand for this product</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div></div><div class="wt-mt-md-6 wt-mt-xs-4"><label for="field-roleInDesignProcess" class="wt-label">What is your role in the design process? <span data-testid="required-badge" aria-hidden="true" data-required-text="Required" class="wt-label__required"></span></label><div data-clg-id="WtSelect" class="wt-select"><select id="field-roleInDesignProcess" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="" class="wt-select__element"><option value=""></option><option value="I_design_everything">I design everything myself</option><option value="I_get_technical_help">I design everything, but get technical help (e.g. CAD, pattern making, etc.)</option><option value="collaborate_with_shop_members">I collaborate with my shop members to design my products</option><option value="my_idea_with_independent_designers">I have an idea, and work with independent designers to realise it</option><option value="collaborate_with_prod_partner">I collaborate with my production partner to design my products</option><option value="contract_with_independent_designers">I contract with independent designers and have rights to their work</option></select></div></div><div class="wt-mt-md-6 wt-mt-xs-4"><label for="field-partnersRole" class="wt-label">What is this partner’s role in the production process? <span data-testid="required-badge" aria-hidden="true" data-required-text="Required" class="wt-label__required"></span></label><div data-clg-id="WtSelect" class="wt-select"><select id="field-partnersRole" aria-invalid="false" aria-describedby="" class="wt-select__element"><option value=""></option><option value="they_make_component">They make a component of my product, and I do the rest</option><option value="I_alter_finished_product">They create a finished product that I then alter/customise</option><option value="I_add_branding_and_packaging">They create a finished product, then I add branding and packaging</option><option value="they_do_everything">They do everything for me</option></select></div></div></div></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooter" class="wt-overlay__sticky-footer-container wt-z-index-1"><div class="wt-overlay__footer wt-align-items-center"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__cancel"><button type="button" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-btn--transparent-flush-left wt-btn--transparent-flush-right">Cancel</button></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__action"><button type="submit" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--filled">Save</button></div></div></div></div></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayChrome" role="dialog" aria-hidden="true" aria-modal="false" aria-label="New Section" class="wt-overlay wt-overlay--info wt-validation wt-overlay--has-close-icon"><div class="wt-overlay__modal"><button type="button" data-clg-id="WtButton" aria-label="Close" class="wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-overlay__close-icon wt-btn--icon wt-btn--light"><span class="etsy-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M17.836 3.768A1 1 0 0 1 19.286 3.73L20.27 4.714A1 1 0 0 1 20.232 6.164L13.742 12 20.232 17.836A1 1 0 0 1 20.27 19.286L19.287 20.27A1 1 0 0 1 17.836 20.232L12 13.742 6.165 20.232A1 1 0 0 1 4.713 20.27L3.73 19.287A1 1 0 0 1 3.768 17.836L10.258 12 3.767 6.165A1 1 0 0 1 3.73 4.714L4.713 3.73A1 1 0 0 1 6.165 3.768L12 10.258z"></path></svg></span></button><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayHeader" class="wt-overlay__header"><h1 class="wt-text-heading">New Section</h1></div><label for="sectionTitle-input" class="mb-xs-1">Section title</label><input data-clg-id="WtInput" type="text" aria-describedby="" id="section" name="section" autofocus="true" aria-invalid="false" class="wt-input"><div class="wt-overlay__footer"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayF