blish-info="true">The publication date will reset to today's date, and the listing will expire four months from today.<span data-auto-renew-info="true">You can turn off auto-renew anytime in Listings. For more details see our <a href="https://www.etsy.com/help/article/2144" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="wt-text-link">Fees &amp; Payments Policy</a></span></p><hr><p data-auto-renew-notice="true" class="wt-text-caption wt-sem-text-secondary">We'll auto-renew every four months at USD 0.20 USD per listing – you can change this anytime in Listings.</p></div></div><div class="wt-overlay__footer"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__cancel"><button type="button" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-btn--transparent-flush-left wt-btn--transparent-flush-right">Cancel</button></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__action"><button type="button" id="shop-manager--listing-publish" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--filled">Publish</button></div></div></div></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayChrome" role="alertdialog" aria-hidden="true" aria-modal="false" aria-label="At least one factor risks lowering this listing's search visibility" class="wt-overlay"><div class="wt-overlay__modal"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayHeader" class="wt-overlay__header"><h1 class="wt-text-title-larger">1 factor risks lowering this listing's search visibility</h1></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayMain" class="wt-overlay__main"><div class="wt-text-body-01"><div><div class="wt-display-flex-xs"><span><span class="wt-sem-bg-surface-warning-light wt-circle wt-mr-xs-2 wt-fill-black etsy-icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11 6V14H13V6zM12 15.25A1.25 1.25 0 1 0 12 17.75 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 12 15.25"></path></svg></span></span><span><p class="wt-mb-xs-1"><b>Not enough photos or videos</b></p><p><span>Adding another photo or video helps show your item at different angles so buyers know what to expect.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div class="wt-overlay__footer"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__cancel"><button type="button" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-btn--transparent-flush-left wt-btn--transparent-flush-right">Skip and continue</button></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__action"><button type="button" id="shop-manager--listing-publish" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--filled">Add more photos</button></div></div></div></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayChrome" role="alertdialog" aria-hidden="true" aria-modal="false" aria-label="Discard changes?" class="wt-overlay"><div class="wt-overlay__modal"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayHeader" class="wt-overlay__header"><h1 class="wt-text-heading">Discard changes?</h1></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayMain" class="wt-overlay__main"><div class="wt-text-body-01">You will lose your changes if you continue without saving.</div></div><div class="wt-overlay__footer"><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__cancel"><button type="button" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-btn--transparent-flush-left wt-btn--transparent-flush-right">Keep editing</button></div><div data-clg-id="WtOverlayFooterButton" class="wt-overlay__footer__action"><button type="button" id="shop-manager--listing-publish" data-clg-id="WtButton" class="wt-btn wt-btn--filled">Discard</button></div></div></div></div><div data-wt-overlay="" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="wt-locale-picker-overlay-title" data-overlay-transition="1" id="wt-locale-picker-overlay" class="v2-locale-picker-overlay wt-overlay">
